#Teacher Script:
"Let's review our sounds. We are doing our Sound Sparks game +Level: Middle. Look up here. When I point to a sound. You will all say that sound when I say go, and when you see my hand close to a fist."
"Ready. My Turn. {Teacher points to /m/.}
Get Ready. Go." (children chorally respond /m/). {Teacher continues this process, reviewing previous sounds. Should be around 2-3 minutes.}
